# Godot 4+ specific ignores
.godot/
/android/
perf_log.csv
perf_log.csv.import
perf_log.*.translation

# Heavy binary assets (models, textures) -- not tracked in git, only the
# project files that reference them. See crosslight_flag_maintenance_cost
# memory / repo-size discussion: git kept rejecting pushes over GitHub's
# 2GB-per-pack limit once these were included in commit history.
# shaders/ is source code, not a binary asset, so it's the one exception.
assets/*
!assets/shaders/
